  "dates": {},
  "summary": "Fixed missing hierarchy lines in Kit diagram by addressing a critical bug in row ID parsing where hyphens in GUIDs were causing incorrect kind/guid extraction. Unified parentGuid and folderGuid mappings in buildKitDiagramData to ensure all relationships (Type-\u003eParent, Design-\u003eParent, File-\u003eFolder, Folder-\u003eParent) are correctly represented as 'part-of' edges with unique prefixed IDs. This ensures that the diagram correctly reflects the kit hierarchy and maintains visibility even when ancestors are collapsed in the table via orphan prevention logic.",
  "github": {
    "issue": "https://github.com/usalu/semio/issues/223"
  }
